  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "MMLottie-2M",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tMMLottie-2M Dataset\n\t\n\nThe first large-scale Lottie animation dataset for multi-modal vector animation generation, containing ~2M samples with diverse motion patterns and visual styles.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Overview\n\t\n\nMMLottie-2M consists of two complementary subsets designed to support comprehensive training for Lottie animation generation:\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t1. Lottie Subset\n\t\n\nNative Lottie animations collected from major online platforms including LottieFiles, IconScout, Flaticon, Iconfont, and\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/OmniLottie/MMLottie-2M.",
  "alternateName": [
    "OmniLottie/MMLottie-2M"
  ],
